 "_note": "Rip /power/V48_B so it can be re-routed at the full 0.635 mm ICD gap. Its netclass could only be set to 0.500 mm - a netclass has no pad-pair exclusion and C108s own two pads sit 0.590 mm apart across V48_B<->Q101_G, the pair the DRU rule deliberately excludes - so Freerouting routed it 0.502-0.524 mm from C106/C107 GND pads. KRT takes the uncapped --net-clearances value of 0.635 instead.",
